      "normalizedSource": "If the value for that key is [`kCFBooleanTrue`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreFoundation/kCFBooleanTrue), the dictionary also contains one or both of the [`kCMSampleBufferConduitNotificationParameter_MinUpcomingOutputPTS`](kcmsamplebufferconduitnotificationparameter_minupcomingoutputpts.md) or [`kCMSampleBufferConduitNotificationParameter_MaxUpcomingOutputPTS`](kcmsamplebufferconduitnotificationparameter_maxupcomingoutputpts.md) keys providing information about the range of overlapping presentation timestamps.",
